--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,16 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add `v1.Files.Upload`, which accepts a file name and reader and builds a
+  replayable multipart upload body.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Make caller-encoded bodies passed to `v1.Files.Add` replayable so file
+  uploads can retry after rate limits and transient server failures.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
