--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -181,6 +181,11 @@ Response bodies are capped at 64 MiB by default. Override globally with
 `WithNoResponseSizeLimit`, and use `client.Files.DownloadTo` to stream large
 v1 file downloads.
 
+For v1 uploads, `client.Files.Upload(ctx, fileName, reader)` builds the
+multipart body and makes it replayable for retries. `client.Files.Add` remains
+available for caller-encoded multipart bodies and now makes those replayable as
+well.
+
